zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E2_08_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E2.8 How much do you trust sending cash through a relative, friend, or another traveler as a safe way to send money to Bangladesh?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Do not trust at all"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Trust a little"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Trust somewhat"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Trust a lot"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Do not know enough about this method to assess it"}],"pairs":[{"value":"98"}]}]}]},{"name":"E3","labels":[{"text":"E3.Before today, were you aware that when money is sent to Bangladesh through eligible formal banking or remittance channels, the recipient may receive an additional cash incentive from the Government of Bangladesh?"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":1,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E3_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E3.Before today, were you aware that when money is sent to Bangladesh through eligible formal banking or remittance channels, the recipient may receive an additional cash incentive from the Government of Bangladesh?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Yes"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"No"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]}]}]},{"name":"E4","labels":[{"text":"E4.To what extent does this government remittance incentive encourage you to send money through eligible formal banking or remittance channels?"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":1,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E4_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E4.To what extent does this government remittance incentive encourage you to send money through eligible formal banking or remittance channels?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Encourages me a lot"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Encourages me somewhat"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Encourages me only a little"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Does not encourage me at all"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]}]}]},{"name":"E5","labels":[{"text":"E5.When sending money through formal channels, such as banks, exchange houses, money transfer operators, or remittance apps, which of the following do you consider to be problems or difficulties?"}],"contentType":"alpha","length":16,"valueSets":[{"name":"E5_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E5.When sending money through formal channels, such as banks, exchange houses, money transfer operators, or remittance apps, which of the following do you consider to be problems or difficulties?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"The exchange rate offered is less favorable than other available options"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Fees, commissions, or overall costs are high"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Branches or agents are too far away or difficult to access"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Services are not available at convenient times"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Identification, visa, or other documentation requirements create difficulties"}],"pairs":[{"value":"5"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Problems related to a bank account, payment card, mobile wallet, or other means of payment"}],"pairs":[{"value":"6"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Apps, websites, or internet-based services are difficult to use"}],"pairs":[{"value":"7"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Language barriers or difficulty understanding instructions"}],"pairs":[{"value":"8"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"The money takes too long to reach the recipient"}],"pairs":[{"value":"9"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Transactions may be delayed, fail, or be returned"}],"pairs":[{"value":"A"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"The recipient in Bangladesh may have difficulty receiving or withdrawing the money"}],"pairs":[{"value":"B"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"I do not have enough confidence or trust in these services"}],"pairs":[{"value":"C"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"It is difficult to obtain assistance or resolve complaints when a problem occurs"}],"pairs":[{"value":"D"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Transfer limits or other rules make it difficult to send the amount needed"}],"pairs":[{"value":"E"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"I do not face any particular problem or difficulty"}],"pairs":[{"value":"F"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Other"}],"pairs":[{"value":"Z"}]}]}]},{"name":"E6","labels":[{"text":"E6.Have you ever tried to send money through a bank, exchange house, money transfer operator, or remittance app but were unable to complete the transaction or ultimately decided not to send the money?"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":2,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E6_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E6.Have you ever tried to send money through a bank, exchange house, money transfer operator, or remittance app but were unable to complete the transaction or ultimately decided not to send the money?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Yes"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"No"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"I have never tried to send money through any of these methods"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]}]}]},{"name":"E7","labels":[{"text":"E7.Why were you unable to complete the transaction, or why did you ultimately not send the money?"}],"contentType":"alpha","length":11,"valueSets":[{"name":"E7_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E7.Why were you unable to complete the transaction, or why did you ultimately not send the money?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"I did not have the required identification or other documents"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"There was a problem with my bank account, payment card, or mobile wallet"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"There was a problem with the recipient's account or information"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"There was a problem with the app, internet connection, or another technical issue"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"The amount I wanted to send exceeded the permitted transfer limit"}],"pairs":[{"value":"5"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"The branch or agent was closed, or the service was not available when I needed it"}],"pairs":[{"value":"6"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"The transaction was delayed, cancelled, failed, or the money was returned"}],"pairs":[{"value":"7"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"The fee or charge was too high or higher than I expected"}],"pairs":[{"value":"8"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"The exchange rate offered was not acceptable to me"}],"pairs":[{"value":"9"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"I could not understand how to complete the transaction"}],"pairs":[{"value":"A"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Other"}],"pairs":[{"value":"Z"}]}]}]},{"name":"E8","labels":[{"text":"E8.Among the Bangladeshis you know in this country, how common do you think it is to send money through hundi or similar informal persons or agents?"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":2,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E8_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E8.Among the Bangladeshis you know in this country, how common do you think it is to send money through hundi or similar informal persons or agents?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Many people send money this way"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Some people send money this way"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Very few people send money this way"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"As far as I know, no one sends money this way"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Do not know"}],"pairs":[{"value":"98"}]}]}]},{"name":"E9","labels":[{"text":"E9.To the best of your knowledge, why do people use hundi or similar informal persons or agents to send money to Bangladesh?"}],"contentType":"alpha","length":12,"valueSets":[{"name":"E9_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E9.To the best of your knowledge, why do people use hundi or similar informal persons or agents to send money to Bangladesh?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"They receive a more favorable exchange rate"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Fees or overall costs are lower"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"The money reaches Bangladesh more quickly"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Little or no identification or other documentation is required"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"The service is easy to access or available at convenient times"}],"pairs":[{"value":"5"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"A bank account or digital financial service is not required"}],"pairs":[{"value":"6"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"The family in Bangladesh can receive the money easily, or cash can be delivered directly to them"}],"pairs":[{"value":"7"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"The person or agent is known to them and therefore trusted"}],"pairs":[{"value":"8"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Their family in Bangladesh can receive money before they themselves receive their salary or income"}],"pairs":[{"value":"9"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Formal remittance services are perceived as complicated or inconvenient"}],"pairs":[{"value":"A"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Do not know"}],"pairs":[{"value":"X"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Other"}],"pairs":[{"value":"Z"}]}]}]},{"name":"E10_DK","labels":[{"text":"E10.1 Do you know or remember the exchange rate received for the last hundi transaction"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":2,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E10_DK_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E10.1 Do you know or remember the exchange rate received for the last hundi transaction"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Yes"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"No"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]}]}]},{"name":"E10_RATE_BDT","labels":[{"text":"E10.2 The last time you sent money through hundi or a similar informal person or agent during the past 12 months, what exchange rate did you receive? Record BDT received for 1 unit of the current country's currency."}],"contentType":"numeric","length":6,"decimals":2,"decimalMark":false,"zeroFill":false},{"name":"E11_STATUS","labels":[{"text":"E11.1 In addition to the exchange rate, did you pay any separate fee, commission, or charge for that hundi transaction?"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":2,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E11_STATUS_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E11.1 In addition to the exchange rate, did you pay any separate fee, commission, or charge for that hundi transaction?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Yes"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"No, there was no separate fee or commission"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Do not know / cannot remember"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]}]}]},{"name":"E11_AMOUNT","labels":[{"text":"E11.2 What was the total amount of the separate fee, commission, or charge paid for that hundi transaction?"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":8,"decimals":2,"decimalMark":false,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E11_AMOUNT_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E11.2 What was the total amount of the separate fee, commission, or charge paid for that hundi transaction?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Enter the amount of fee or commission"}],"pairs":[{"range":["0.00","999999.00"]}]}]}]},{"name":"E11_CURRENCY","labels":[{"text":"E11.3 Currency of the separate fee, commission, or charge paid for that hundi transaction"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":1,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E11_CURRENCY_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E11.3 Currency of the separate fee, commission, or charge paid for that hundi transaction"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Pound Sterling (GBP)"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Malaysian Ringgit (MYR)"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"US Dollar (USD)"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"UAE Dirham (AED)"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Saudi Riyal (SAR)"}],"pairs":[{"value":"5"}]}]}]},{"name":"E12","labels":[{"text":"E12.During the past 12 months, did you experience any problems when sending money through hundi or a similar informal person or agent?"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":1,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E12_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E12.During the past 12 months, did you experience any problems when sending money through hundi or a similar informal person or agent?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Yes"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"No"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]}]}]},{"name":"E13","labels":[{"text":"E13.What problems did you experience when sending money through hundi or a similar informal person or agent?"}],"contentType":"alpha","length":9,"valueSets":[{"name":"E13_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E13.What problems did you experience when sending money through hundi or a similar informal person or agent?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"The money took longer than expected to reach the recipient"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"The recipient in Bangladesh received less money than expected"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"The money did not reach the recipient"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Money was lost or I was a victim of fraud"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"I did not receive the exchange rate that had been agreed or quoted"}],"pairs":[{"value":"5"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"I had to pay an additional or unexpected fee or cost"}],"pairs":[{"value":"6"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"I could not contact the person or agent when needed"}],"pairs":[{"value":"7"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"It was difficult to resolve the problem because there was no receipt or other proof of the transaction"}],"pairs":[{"value":"8"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Other"}],"pairs":[{"value":"Z"}]}]}]},{"name":"E14","labels":[{"text":"E14.Are you aware of any arrangement in which, when a family in Bangladesh urgently needs money, a person or agent provides the money to the family first and the sender repays that person or agent later - for example, after receiving their salary? "}],"contentType":"numeric","length":1,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E14_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E14.Are you aware of any arrangement in which, when a family in Bangladesh urgently needs money, a person or agent provides the money to the family first and the sender repays that person or agent later - for example, after receiving their salary? "}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Yes"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"No"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]}]}]},{"name":"E15","labels":[{"text":"E15.During the past 12 months, have you used this type of arrangement where a person or agent provides money to your family first and you repay that person or agent later?"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":1,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E15_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E15.During the past 12 months, have you used this type of arrangement where a person or agent provides money to your family first and you repay that person or agent later?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Yes"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"No"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]}]}]},{"name":"E16","labels":[{"text":"E16.The last time you used this arrangement, did you incur any cost beyond repaying the amount that had been provided to your family?"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":2,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E16_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E16.The last time you used this arrangement, did you incur any cost beyond repaying the amount that had been provided to your family?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"No; I repaid only the amount that had been provided"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Yes; I paid a separate fee or commission"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Yes; I received a less favorable exchange rate than would normally have been available"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Yes; I paid a separate fee/commission and also received a less favorable exchange rate"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Do not know / cannot remember"}],"pairs":[{"value":"98"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Other"}],"pairs":[{"value":"99"}]}]}]},{"name":"E17_DK","labels":[{"text":"E17.1 Do you know or remember the separate fee or commission paid"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":2,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E17_DK_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E17.1 Do you know or remember the separate fee or commission paid"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Yes"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"No"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]}]}]},{"name":"E17_AMOUNT","labels":[{"text":"E17.2 The last time you used this arrangement, how much did you pay as a separate fee or commission?"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":8,"decimals":2,"decimalMark":false,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E17_AMOUNT_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E17.2 The last time you used this arrangement, how much did you pay as a separate fee or commission?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Enter the amount of fee or commission"}],"pairs":[{"range":["0.00","999999.00"]}]}]}]},{"name":"E17_CURRENCY","labels":[{"text":"E17.3 Currency of the separate fee or commission paid for this arrangement"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":1,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E17_CURRENCY_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E17.3 Currency of the separate fee or commission paid for this arrangement"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Pound Sterling (GBP)"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Malaysian Ringgit (MYR)"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"US Dollar (USD)"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"UAE Dirham (AED)"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Saudi Riyal (SAR)"}],"pairs":[{"value":"5"}]}]}]},{"name":"E18","labels":[{"text":"E18.Suppose an authorized remittance service allowed your family in Bangladesh to receive money immediately in an urgent need, while you repaid the amount after receiving your salary or other income. How interested would you be in using such a service?"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":1,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E18_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E18.Suppose an authorized remittance service allowed your family in Bangladesh to receive money immediately in an urgent need, while you repaid the amount after receiving your salary or other income. How interested would you be in using such a service?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Definitely interested"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Probably interested"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Not sure yet"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Probably not interested"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Definitely not interested"}],"pairs":[{"value":"5"}]}]}]},{"name":"E19","labels":[{"text":"E19.If you wanted reliable information or advice on how to send money to Bangladesh safely and at low cost, which source would you trust the most?"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":2,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"E19_VS1","labels":[{"text":"E19.If you wanted reliable information or advice on how to send money to Bangladesh safely and at low cost, which source would you trust the most?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Bangladesh Embassy, High Commission, or Consulate"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Bangladesh Bank or another government agency"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"A bank, exchange house, or remittance service provider"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Employer"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Recruiting agency"}],"pairs":[{"value":"5"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Bangladeshi migrant association, community organization, or community leader"}],"pairs":[{"value":"6"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Friends, relatives, or family members"}],"pairs":[{"value":"7"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Social media or other online sources"}],"pairs":[{"value":"8"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"I would not particularly trust any of these sources"}],"pairs":[{"value":"96"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Other"}],"pairs":[{"value":"99"}]}]}]}]},{"name":"MODULE_F","labels":[{"text":"MODULE F: ACCESS TO AND USE OF FINANCIAL AND DIGITAL SERVICES"}],"recordType":"7","occurrences":{"required":true,"maximum":1},"items":[{"name":"F1","labels":[{"text":"F1.Which of the following financial accounts, cards, or digital financial services do you currently have in your own name in this country?"}],"contentType":"alpha","length":5,"valueSets":[{"name":"F1_VS1","labels":[{"text":"F1.Which of the following financial accounts, cards, or digital financial services do you currently have in your own name in this country?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Bank account"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Payroll or prepaid card/account used to receive salary or wages"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Mobile wallet, e-wallet, or other digital money account"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"None of the above"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Other"}],"pairs":[{"value":"Z"}]}]}]},{"name":"F1_01","labels":[{"text":"F1.1 If \"others\" is chosen, please specify"}],"contentType":"alpha","length":100},{"name":"F2","labels":[{"text":"F2.Do you have access to a smartphone that can connect to the internet?"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":1,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"F2_VS1","labels":[{"text":"F2.Do you have access to a smartphone that can connect to the internet?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Yes, I have my own smartphone"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"I do not have my own smartphone, but I can use someone else's smartphone when needed"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"No, I do not have access to an internet-enabled smartphone"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]}]}]},{"name":"F3","labels":[{"text":"F3.Are you able to use a bank app, internet banking, or a remittance app to send money or carry out a financial transaction by yourself?"}],"contentType":"numeric","length":1,"zeroFill":false,"valueSets":[{"name":"F3_VS1","labels":[{"text":"F3.Are you able to use a bank app, internet banking, or a remittance app to send money or carry out a financial transaction by yourself?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"Yes, I can do so easily without assistance"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Yes, but I need some assistance"}],"pairs":[{"value