bers"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Loans or other debts need to be repaid in cash"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Using a bank account or MFS is not convenient"}],"pairs":[{"value":"5"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"There are problems with network connectivity, agents, or banking services"}],"pairs":[{"value":"6"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"There is little perceived benefit from keeping money in a bank or MFS account"}],"pairs":[{"value":"7"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"There is limited experience or confidence in using money digitally"}],"pairs":[{"value":"8"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"The recipient is more comfortable using cash"}],"pairs":[{"value":"9"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"There are concerns about account security or the risk of fraud"}],"pairs":[{"value":"A"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Do not know"}],"pairs":[{"value":"X"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Other"}],"pairs":[{"value":"Z"}]}]}]},{"name":"G7","labels":[{"text":"G7.Which changes do you think are most important for making it easier, more affordable, and more convenient to send money to Bangladesh through authorized remittance channels?"}],"contentType":"alpha","length":6,"valueSets":[{"name":"G7_VS1","labels":[{"text":"G7.Which changes do you think are most important for making it easier, more affordable, and more convenient to send money to Bangladesh through authorized remittance channels?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"More favorable exchange rates"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Lower fees, commissions, and other costs"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Easier access to branches or agents and services available at more convenient times"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Simpler documentation requirements and procedures"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Easier-to-use apps and websites"}],"pairs":[{"value":"5"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Faster transfer of money to Bangladesh"}],"pairs":[{"value":"6"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Safer and more reliable transactions"}],"pairs":[{"value":"7"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Easier and less costly ways for recipients in Bangladesh to receive or withdraw the money"}],"pairs":[{"value":"8"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Faster customer support and more effective complaint resolution"}],"pairs":[{"value":"9"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"A more attractive government remittance incentive"}],"pairs":[{"value":"A"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"A simpler and more reliable process for receiving the government remittance incentive"}],"pairs":[{"value":"B"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Clear and trustworthy information on remittance costs, exchange rates, and available transfer methods"}],"pairs":[{"value":"C"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"No particular change is needed"}],"pairs":[{"value":"D"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Other"}],"pairs":[{"value":"Z"}]}]}]},{"name":"G8","labels":[{"text":"G8.Of the changes you selected, which one is the most important to you?"}],"contentType":"alpha","length":1,"valueSets":[{"name":"G8_VS1","labels":[{"text":"G8.Of the changes you selected, which one is the most important to you?"}],"values":[{"labels":[{"text":"More favorable exchange rates"}],"pairs":[{"value":"1"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Lower fees, commissions, and other costs"}],"pairs":[{"value":"2"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Easier access to branches or agents and services available at more convenient times"}],"pairs":[{"value":"3"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Simpler documentation requirements and procedures"}],"pairs":[{"value":"4"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Easier-to-use apps and websites"}],"pairs":[{"value":"5"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Faster transfer of money to Bangladesh"}],"pairs":[{"value":"6"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Safer and more reliable transactions"}],"pairs":[{"value":"7"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Easier and less costly ways for recipients in Bangladesh to receive or withdraw the money"}],"pairs":[{"value":"8"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"Faster customer support and more effective complaint resolution"}],"pairs":[{"value":"9"}]},{"labels":[{"text":"